{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><u>Craggenrock</u></strong>, play as Arlo, a budding blacksmith returning to the monster-infested island of Halina. Set up shop in the recovering town of Pareho, craft essential gear for adventurers and locals, and build your name (and your fortune) from the forge up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Master the craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from hundreds of materials and recipes. Prepare components at various workstations, then time your inputs in a <u><strong>skill-based crafting system</strong></u> to forge high-quality gear. Use catalysts to raise your creations\u2019 stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, unlock a unique recipe influenced by your choices: your very own Craggenrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Stock, price, profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop full and <u><strong>price your items based on their quality</strong></u> to keep customers coming back. Running out of stock? Visit other merchants and grab anything from wood and fabric, to herbs and gastric acid!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1Hone skills and talents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Crafting and Sales skills and <u><strong>invest in talents</strong></u> to shape your playstyle. Want to earn bigger tips? Boost the stats of mastered items? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd51Take on jobs (and haggle for better deals)\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Get jobs</strong></u> from adventurers for extra income. <u><strong>Haggle</strong></u> for higher offers<strong> </strong>with small talk, confidence and maybe desperation. Just don\u2019t miss your deadlines!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Get involved with the town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know life in Pareho and support the town's efforts to rebuild itself with <u><strong>town donations</strong></u>. Expand your shop as you rediscover life back in Arlo's old hometown.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starting Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/3e712f5758cc481b5eac9903865181f8d6c537b9.jpg"},{"name":"A Layer of Protection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/3b6ad52892678faaeea1b94645c7bffa6bb5ef21.jpg"},{"name":"Buckled Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/7639bbe658d77b61a4d971be3b28ad3269fc2d58.jpg"},{"name":"Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/da43f19844f9f453462e718a7cba243406aaad80.jpg"},{"name":"One More Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/4f23115ad7a81df913b1a611f37f10a875b5b64a.jpg"},{"name":"That's Plain Math","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/0e0d8db9ceb84543c555ed6cd27b8a6087e4f8fa.jpg"},{"name":"Staying Up Lathe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/a3028c0b2a54e53e0aa4a44dbc1f2025f9b337a9.jpg"},{"name":"Needlework","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/4e9dcd7db91701a49125d661e2384f18ac386cda.jpg"},{"name":"Shears to That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/58923a0f499261fbd3829a20998304eefc315ca8.jpg"},{"name":"Smokin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1889160/778032721e1861c9aeba54189dc5bc1e7e71c51e.jpg"}],"total":52},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1889160?t=1771618845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889160/c3c2a2c38218056e137b21f7a1959d2931bffc13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771618845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889160/00c2b2d8366559ac8ffeedd75ace06bcef2c1d96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771618845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889160/00c2b2d8366559ac8ffeedd75ace06bcef2c1d96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771618845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><u>Craggenrock</u></strong>, play as Arlo, a budding blacksmith returning to the monster-infested island of Halina. Set up shop in the recovering town of Pareho, craft essential gear for adventurers and locals, and build your name (and your fortune) from the forge up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Master the craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from hundreds of materials and recipes. Prepare components at various workstations, then time your inputs in a <u><strong>skill-based crafting system</strong></u> to forge high-quality gear. Use catalysts to raise your creations\u2019 stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, unlock a unique recipe influenced by your choices: your very own Craggenrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2696\ufe0f Stock, price, profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop full and <u><strong>price your items based on their quality</strong></u> to keep customers coming back. Running out of stock? Visit other merchants and grab anything from wood and fabric, to herbs and gastric acid!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1Hone skills and talents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Crafting and Sales skills and <u><strong>invest in talents</strong></u> to shape your playstyle. Want to earn bigger tips? Boost the stats of mastered items? The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd51Take on jobs (and haggle for better deals)\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Get jobs</strong></u> from adventurers for extra income. <u><strong>Haggle</strong></u> for higher offers<strong> </strong>with small talk, confidence and maybe desperation. Just don\u2019t miss your deadlines!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Get involved with the town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know life in Pareho and support the town's efforts to rebuild itself with <u><strong>town donations</strong></u>. Expand your shop as you rediscover life back in Arlo's old hometown.</p>","developers":["Ardeimon"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889160/f32345c9bbea0be48178335aca10985a79d082d0/header.jpg?t=1771618845","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1889160/2012872523/5f75c651b4f6dd934c76a4a987b153bf37440593/1753086432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753102429","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1889160/2012872523/5f75c651b4f6dd934c76a4a987b153bf37440593/1753086432/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753102429","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1889160/2012872523/5f75c651b4f6dd934c76a4a987b153bf37440593/1753086432/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753102429","id":257171714,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171714/cd244aebc1e856656e4b2af7023b14854ba029c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753102429"}],"name":"Craggenrock","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_descripti